# Purpose

The purpose of this project is to build a simple java application that bridges normal sockets to websockets.

When building for the browser, we can't just open up a connection to a TCP server, or subscribe to UDP multicast.

This project aims to on one hand subscribe to TCP as a client, or create a TCP server, or subscribe to UDP multicast,
and at the same time present a websocket connection. The goal of all this is that we can take data from the websocket
and transfer it to the "legacy" socket, and the legacy socket data can be transferred into the websocket.
